    "text": {
     "en": "To hop is to jump on one or two feet. Beware means be careful of danger.\nMuddy means covered with mud. To croak is to make the deep sound of a frog.\nTo flick is to move quickly and lightly, as the frog flicks its tongue.\nWebbed feet have skin between the toes for swimming. Damp means slightly wet, and dew is tiny drops of water on grass in the morning.\nUse each word in a sentence."
    }
